{"id":"140871d34b5babf2","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-robinson-embed.md","title":"非零 c.e. 度存在非零严格下度","display":"thm-robinson-embed — 非零 c.e. 度存在非零严格下度","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-robinson-embed","aliases":["20-thm-robinson-embed"],"display":"thm-robinson-embed — 非零 c.e. 度存在非零严格下度","chapter":"7","section":"7.5","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Corollary 7.5.3 的直接推论","source_pdf_pages":[193],"source_printed_pages":[159],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-ambos-split]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-robinson-embed"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-robinson-embed</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-robinson-embed — 非零 c.e. 度存在非零严格下度"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Corollary 7.5.3 的直接推论"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>193</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>159</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1013cc25d82f1ed8\" href=\"?note=1013cc25d82f1ed8\" title=\"20-thm-ambos-split\">20-thm-ambos-split</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\setminus\\{\\mathbf0\\}\">\\(\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\setminus\\{\\mathbf0\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1013cc25d82f1ed8\" href=\"?note=1013cc25d82f1ed8\" title=\"20-thm-ambos-split\">20-thm-ambos-split</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}robinson\\text{-}embed}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\ [\\mathbf0&lt;\\mathbf a&lt;\\mathbf b].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}robinson\\text{-}embed}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\ [\\mathbf0&lt;\\mathbf a&lt;\\mathbf b].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取 Sacks 分裂的一边。原 Robinson embedding 名称与这条弱存在性不对应；保留旧标识并准确说明这是分裂推论，不声称有限偏序嵌入定理。</p>\n<p>来源：Corollary 7.5.3 的直接推论；印刷页 159；PDF 第 193 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-ambos-split","status":"resolved","id":"1013cc25d82f1ed8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-ambos-split]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-ambos-split","status":"resolved","id":"1013cc25d82f1ed8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-ambos-split]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\setminus\\{\\mathbf0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}robinson\\text{-}embed}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\ [\\mathbf0<\\mathbf a<\\mathbf b].","display":true}],"bytes":1103,"backlinks":[{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-320","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-robinson-embed]] — 章 7；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-320","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-robinson-embed]]"}],"outgoing":["1013cc25d82f1ed8"]}